WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:10.110
It turns and turns, this wheel of light...

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:15.104
Warm and gentle, like a dream.

00:02:27.894 --> 00:02:32.599
Look, Ryoko has begun to leave.

00:02:32.599 --> 00:02:36.194
Her time to dream will end soon.

00:02:38.038 --> 00:02:40.734
Yes. I'm making it end.

00:04:02.455 --> 00:04:03.723
Hey, baby!

00:04:03.723 --> 00:04:06.726
You look lonely!
Did your boyfriend dump you?

00:04:06.726 --> 00:04:08.695
We'll make you feel better!

00:04:08.695 --> 00:04:11.831
Forget about that guy,
and let's go have some fun!

00:04:11.831 --> 00:04:14.601
Come on, let's go! You're alone, right?

00:04:14.601 --> 00:04:17.137
He won't show up, no matter
how long you wait! Let's go!

00:04:17.137 --> 00:04:19.239
Yeah, he ain't gonna come!

00:04:19.239 --> 00:04:21.174
Get lost.

00:04:21.174 --> 00:04:23.209
What? Are you mad?

00:04:23.209 --> 00:04:26.313
Did we say something that made you mad?

00:04:26.313 --> 00:04:28.679
Beat it!

00:04:33.853 --> 00:04:35.650
What's her problem?

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:04.940
Ryoko!

00:05:11.358 --> 00:05:12.848
Tenchi?

00:05:20.634 --> 00:05:22.966
So what's next?

00:05:29.309 --> 00:05:30.799
Tenchi!

00:06:00.607 --> 00:06:02.097
What the...?

00:06:22.362 --> 00:06:23.563
That hurt!

00:06:23.563 --> 00:06:25.497
What was that?

00:06:31.871 --> 00:06:35.075
No doubt about it...
Somebody's trying to kill me.

00:06:35.075 --> 00:06:38.135
They're trying to take just me
out without anybody noticing...

00:06:39.145 --> 00:06:42.515
Where is he? Where is he?

00:06:42.515 --> 00:06:43.850
Where is he?

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:46.011
Where is he? Where?! Where is he?!

00:07:12.178 --> 00:07:16.114
I can't believe this... Am I pathetic or what?

00:07:22.055 --> 00:07:23.750
That's...!

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.242
Hey, Tenchi!

00:07:42.242 --> 00:07:43.243
What's wrong?

00:07:43.243 --> 00:07:44.644
Uh... It's nothing.

00:07:44.644 --> 00:07:50.016
Oh. Anyway, I was asked to
go do something over break.

00:07:50.016 --> 00:07:53.611
I was wondering if you could
come with us if you have time.

00:08:05.765 --> 00:08:07.528
This place... It's...

00:08:15.141 --> 00:08:18.804
Damn it... What the hell is going on?

00:08:26.986 --> 00:08:28.154
You!

00:08:28.154 --> 00:08:32.292
Harsh words, for someone who's
been sneaking around my manor.

00:08:32.292 --> 00:08:34.761
Now I get it! You're behind all this!

00:08:34.761 --> 00:08:36.229
Wait! Listen to what I have to say!

00:08:36.229 --> 00:08:37.856
Shove it!

00:08:46.105 --> 00:08:47.807
Look at that.

00:08:47.807 --> 00:08:49.142
Let go of me!

00:08:49.142 --> 00:08:51.201
Look at it, I said!

00:08:52.245 --> 00:08:54.236
What's with you?

00:09:03.623 --> 00:09:04.991
What the...?

00:09:04.991 --> 00:09:09.896
They're the Galaxy Police's Bioroids,
used against class-one criminals.

00:09:09.896 --> 00:09:15.401
Combat machines used to quickly and
quietly capture or eliminate those criminals.

00:09:15.401 --> 00:09:19.606
Combat Bioroids? What the heck
are things like that doing here?

00:09:19.606 --> 00:09:22.709
Have you forgotten who you are?

00:09:22.709 --> 00:09:25.144
They've started to get down
to business and deal with

00:09:25.144 --> 00:09:27.847
Ryoko, the worst space pirate in history.

00:09:27.847 --> 00:09:29.349
Get real!

00:09:29.349 --> 00:09:32.185
I suffered a defeat at
their hands six months ago.

00:09:32.185 --> 00:09:35.855
Since then, I've laid low on
this planet, waiting for my chance.

00:09:35.855 --> 00:09:37.390
Your chance?

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:39.517
That's right.

00:09:41.661 --> 00:09:43.396
I've been waiting a long time!

00:09:43.396 --> 00:09:47.332
Waiting for someone powerful
to fly through the galaxy with me!

00:09:49.836 --> 00:09:53.897
And now I've finally found her!
I've found my perfect companion!

00:10:20.166 --> 00:10:22.802
Ryoko! Come with me!

00:10:22.802 --> 00:10:25.862
You belong in space!

00:10:51.064 --> 00:10:54.133
You're right... It's almost summer vacation.

00:10:54.133 --> 00:10:56.069
It sure has come up fast, huh?

00:10:56.069 --> 00:10:58.805
Oh, right! Matsuno and the others
say that they're all going to the beach.

00:10:58.805 --> 00:11:00.473
"Summer Break by Sakuya"
Oh, right! Matsuno and the others
say that they're all going to the beach.

00:11:00.473 --> 00:11:01.341
"Summer Break by Sakuya"
The beach, huh?

00:11:01.341 --> 00:11:01.808
The beach, huh?

00:11:01.808 --> 00:11:04.310
Now that you mention it,
I haven't gone in a long time.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:05.912
Really?

00:11:05.912 --> 00:11:10.750
Not since I went with
my family when I was little.

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:14.587
We went by bike from my
cousin's house in Okayama.

00:11:14.587 --> 00:11:20.193
And at the bottom of a hill, there it was.
The sea, blue as far as the eye could see.

00:11:20.193 --> 00:11:24.497
The spray of the water, the crashing
of the waves, the hot, white sand...

00:11:24.497 --> 00:11:27.022
It was so pretty it was like a dream.

00:11:29.435 --> 00:11:33.573
My dad says that I threw a tantrum
because I didn't want to go home.

00:11:33.573 --> 00:11:35.975
The sea by your hometown...

00:11:35.975 --> 00:11:39.245
That's so great!

00:11:39.245 --> 00:11:41.447
Look...

00:11:41.447 --> 00:11:44.617
Do you want to go there with me?

00:11:44.617 --> 00:11:51.524
It's a long way to Okayama,
but I bet it hasn't changed.

00:11:51.524 --> 00:11:53.014
Tenchi...

00:11:58.998 --> 00:12:01.193
Will you let me ride a bike there?

00:12:03.102 --> 00:12:04.737
You bet!

00:12:04.737 --> 00:12:06.534
Then count me in!

00:12:27.393 --> 00:12:31.193
Go home! You cause nothing
but trouble when you're around.

00:12:32.665 --> 00:12:38.504
Lord Tenchi... Does Lord Tenchi
no longer need us around now?

00:12:38.504 --> 00:12:42.341
No! No! I believe in Lord Tenchi!

00:12:42.341 --> 00:12:47.513
Even if the whole
world says I'm wrong, I... I...

00:12:47.513 --> 00:12:51.040
What should I do?

00:13:00.793 --> 00:13:03.162
Ryoko! Come with me!

00:13:03.162 --> 00:13:06.065
Why should I team up with you?

00:13:06.065 --> 00:13:09.168
Because you're a true space pirate!

00:13:09.168 --> 00:13:13.662
No way. I don't feel like teaming up
with anybody or going into space!

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:29.754
Idiot! What are you doing?!

00:13:30.123 --> 00:13:33.092
Shove it! You've got
nothing to do with this!

00:13:33.092 --> 00:13:36.162
Is that so? I won't abandon my partner!

00:13:36.162 --> 00:13:38.030
Who are you calling your partner?

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:39.599
Have you forgotten?

00:13:39.599 --> 00:13:41.567
Forgotten your days of
traveling to countless worlds,

00:13:41.567 --> 00:13:44.003
doing nothing but fighting and destroying?

00:13:44.003 --> 00:13:45.471
Shut up!

00:13:45.471 --> 00:13:49.876
What we search for can only be had
through blood, flames, and tragedy!

00:13:49.876 --> 00:13:52.745
There's a more appropriate
place for you than this world!

00:13:52.745 --> 00:13:54.747
I told you to shut up!

00:13:54.747 --> 00:13:56.983
Why are you so attached to this world?

00:13:56.983 --> 00:13:59.852
What keeps you on
such an inferior, pathetic,

00:13:59.852 --> 00:14:01.854
unstimulating, worthless little planet?

00:14:01.854 --> 00:14:03.022
Shut up!

00:14:03.022 --> 00:14:04.690
It's not worthless!

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.993
Staying here on this
planet means something to me!

00:14:06.993 --> 00:14:08.756
It means something...

00:14:09.962 --> 00:14:11.623
It...

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:33.544
Damn it...

00:14:35.054 --> 00:14:37.784
Damn it...

00:14:39.258 --> 00:14:42.955
Damn it!

00:14:59.111 --> 00:15:01.705
Earth doesn't suit you.

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:07.585
Come with me, Ryoko.

00:15:55.001 --> 00:15:58.037
You can't fall asleep, Princess Ayeka?

00:15:58.037 --> 00:16:00.740
How do you know my name?

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:04.777
Who in the world are you?

00:16:04.777 --> 00:16:06.836
A magician.

00:16:09.215 --> 00:16:13.686
I've come to unravel the
knots in your heart, Princess.

00:16:13.686 --> 00:16:15.321
What do you mean?

00:16:15.321 --> 00:16:19.992
For instance, the
gentleman you love, Princess.

00:16:19.992 --> 00:16:21.823
Watch.

00:16:24.697 --> 00:16:27.433
It's sad... It's so sad...

00:16:27.433 --> 00:16:29.869
No matter how much
you care for him, Princess,

00:16:29.869 --> 00:16:33.168
his heart won't return to you.

00:16:37.476 --> 00:16:42.081
He has found a new world and a new love.

00:16:42.081 --> 00:16:44.684
People will always change.

00:16:44.684 --> 00:16:46.686
It's a lie...

00:16:46.686 --> 00:16:47.853
It's no lie.

00:16:47.853 --> 00:16:50.589
It's a lie! A lie! A lie! Lord Tenchi, he...

00:16:50.589 --> 00:16:54.491
Lord Tenchi would never
do something like this!

00:16:56.796 --> 00:16:58.731
Are you so sure?

00:16:58.731 --> 00:17:01.894
Somewhere in your heart, don't
you think the same thing, Princess?

00:17:03.602 --> 00:17:05.729
He'd never do it.

00:17:09.642 --> 00:17:14.875
If you were to ask him outright,
I think it would clear things up.

00:17:19.819 --> 00:17:22.754
I'll always be by your side, Princess.

00:17:31.063 --> 00:17:33.497
That is proof of it.

00:17:35.534 --> 00:17:37.195
Wait!

00:18:03.929 --> 00:18:08.764
If you were to ask him outright,
I think it would clear things up.

00:18:10.536 --> 00:18:12.697
Lord Tenchi...

00:18:20.679 --> 00:18:22.613
Allow me!

00:18:34.693 --> 00:18:36.629
Hello, Masaki residence.

00:18:36.629 --> 00:18:38.097
Tenchi?

00:18:38.097 --> 00:18:39.999
Good morning! This is Sasami!

00:18:39.999 --> 00:18:44.403
Are you eating right? Having
nothing but TV dinners is bad for you.

00:18:44.403 --> 00:18:46.138
Right. Sure!

00:18:46.138 --> 00:18:48.707
That's okay! Sure!

00:18:48.707 --> 00:18:54.547
Oh, right. Ayeka said she wanted
to talk to you about something.

00:18:54.547 --> 00:18:56.549
Here.

00:18:56.549 --> 00:18:58.346
Sasami...

00:19:00.719 --> 00:19:03.688
Come on, hurry!

00:19:05.658 --> 00:19:09.795
Um... It's been a long time, Lord Tenchi.

00:19:09.795 --> 00:19:13.132
A long time? We saw each other yesterday.

00:19:13.132 --> 00:19:16.402
It's been a long time for me.

00:19:16.402 --> 00:19:20.306
Look... I'm sorry, but I have to go.

00:19:20.306 --> 00:19:22.508
Just a minute! Please wait!

00:19:22.508 --> 00:19:23.742
What is it?

00:19:23.742 --> 00:19:28.781
Um... Are you getting
along with your classmates?

00:19:28.781 --> 00:19:30.649
Sure. I guess.

00:19:30.649 --> 00:19:35.087
With... her, too?

00:19:35.087 --> 00:19:38.386
With... Kumashiro, too?

00:19:49.335 --> 00:19:52.137
I'm sorry. Hang on a minute.

00:19:52.137 --> 00:19:54.373
L-Lord Tenchi!

00:19:54.373 --> 00:19:55.975
Sorry! I'm coming!

00:19:55.975 --> 00:19:59.645
We're late, Tenchi!
We'll have to run again!

00:19:59.645 --> 00:20:01.514
Uh... Who do we have
for first period again?

00:20:01.514 --> 00:20:02.848
Ancient Literature with Mr. Kita.

00:20:02.848 --> 00:20:04.083
Oh, okay. We'll be fine.

00:20:04.083 --> 00:20:07.211
Hey, your necktie's crooked again!

00:20:09.255 --> 00:20:12.418
Ayeka, I'll call you later!

00:20:16.462 --> 00:20:18.230
Ready to go?

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.720
Yeah!

00:20:27.706 --> 00:20:29.196
Sister...

00:20:44.123 --> 00:20:46.023
Goodbye.

00:20:55.601 --> 00:20:57.193
Begone.

00:21:02.708 --> 00:21:05.370
Bye, Ryoko.

00:21:35.975 --> 00:21:39.578
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.578 --> 00:21:43.482
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.482 --> 00:21:47.086
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.086 --> 00:21:51.023
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.023 --> 00:21:54.526
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.526 --> 00:21:58.497
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.497 --> 00:22:01.834
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:01.834 --> 00:22:05.838
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:05.838 --> 00:22:07.973
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:07.973 --> 00:22:09.908
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:09.908 --> 00:22:11.410
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:17.249
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.249 --> 00:22:21.353
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.353 --> 00:22:24.623
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.623 --> 00:22:28.160
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:32.859
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:43.308 --> 00:22:44.843
This is Ayeka!

00:22:44.843 --> 00:22:47.880
Mihoshi and Kiyone,
congratulations on your promotion.

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:51.417
But it will be lonely here with you
being transferred from Earth to Pluto.

00:22:51.417 --> 00:22:55.854
Washu is still holed up in
her lab, and Ryoko is missing.

00:22:55.854 --> 00:23:00.726
I can't believe that our once-noisy
breakfast table has become so lonely.

00:23:00.726 --> 00:23:04.963
Lord Tenchi, what in the
world will become of us?

00:23:04.963 --> 00:23:10.401
Next time on
<i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i> "Game Over."
